    <rel_range>63:6</rel_range>
    <field_description order="before"><para>Base address of Instruction Region Table.</para>
<para>Bits [63:6] of the address are the value of this field.</para>
<para>Bits [5:0] of the address are zero.</para></field_description>
    <field_description order="after">
      <para>The least significant bits of this field are <arm-defined-word>RES0</arm-defined-word>, so that the base address of the table is aligned to the size of the table. If the table is smaller than 64B, then the address is aligned to 64B.</para>
    </field_description>
    <field_resets>
